      "title": "Faculty (Teaching or Tenure Track) - Villa Maria School of Nursing",
      "description": "Gannon University | Faculty (Teaching or Tenure Track) - Villa Maria School of Nursing Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Search Position Description Library Log In /Create Account Help Faculty (Teaching or Tenure Track) - Villa Maria School of Nursing Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Posting Summary Position Title Faculty (Teaching or Tenure Track) - Villa Maria School of Nursing Posting Number F255P Division School of Health Professions Department Col.Health Professions & Sci. Location Erie, Pa Position Summary Gannon University is committed to excellence in student-centered learning with an emphasis on student-learning outcomes. The faculty work collaboratively with colleagues; deliver instruction; advise students; engage in scholarly activities in keeping with the Boyer Model of Scholarship as is appropriate to the application and receipt of tenure and promotion at Gannon; and engage in professional, University, and community service activities. All faculty must be able to support and promote the University’s inclusive Mission, its Catholic identity, and its liberal arts and professional education traditions. The Villa Maria School of Nursing currently has one 9-month faculty position available which will be responsible for teaching in both the undergraduate and the graduate programs and clinical education, as assigned. Candidates must provide evidence of competence in diverse teaching methods and effective classroom and clinical instruction. Required Qualifications Must be a registered nurse with a master’s degree in nursing. Must possess or be eligible to obtain nursing licensure in Pennsylvania. Must be able to support and promote the University’s inclusive Mission, its Catholic identity, and its liberal arts and professional education traditions. Preferred Qualifications An earned doctorate in nursing or a closely related field; applicants who are enrolled or in the process of enrolling to doctoral programs are also encouraged to apply. Recent clinical and teaching experience in a program of higher education. Background in Mom and Baby or OB/ GYN Physical Demands Must be able to meet the physical demands associated with a busy academic and clinical environment. Tenure Status Tenure Track Position Type Regular Faculty Employment Status Full-Time Position Length 9M Credits Per Year 24 (tenure track) or 27 (teaching track) Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Cover Letter Curriculum Vitae Teaching Statement Optional Documents Resume Transcripts Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Erie, Pennsylvania Campus 109 University Square Erie, Pennsylvania 16541 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 Ruskin, Florida Campus 105 Commercial Center Dr. Ruskin, Florida 33573 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
