    "https://gannon.peopleadmin.com/postings/14694": {
      "title": "Adjuncts - Dahlkemper School of Business",
      "description": "Gannon University | Adjuncts - Dahlkemper School of Business Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Search Position Description Library Log In /Create Account Help Adjuncts - Dahlkemper School of Business Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Posting Summary Position Title Adjuncts - Dahlkemper School of Business Posting Number AP038 Division School of Business Department Col. of Engineering & Business Location Erie, Pa Position Summary Gannon University’s Dahlkemper School of Business ( DSB ) seeks to expand its pool for qualified adjuncts for its undergraduate program areas. DSB offers undergraduate majors in: Accounting, Finance, Economics, Management, Marketing, Aviation & Business Management, and Sport Business. It offers optional tracks in Supply Chain Management, Global Business, Risk Management and Insurance, and Entrepreneurship. Almost all undergraduate classes run face to face on the Erie, PA campus. Opportunities exist for major courses as well as foundational courses in the business core for all disciplines as well as business statistics. Minor programs in Business Analytics and Event Security represent additional opportunities for adjuncts. This posting is collecting applications for only the undergraduate programs. Adjuncts interested in teaching for the graduate programs should apply under the appropriate post. Required Qualifications Successful candidates interested in the undergraduate courses, without an earned doctorate, require a Master’s degree in a business area with extensive teaching or professional experience, including the use of appropriate technologies. Preferred Qualifications Physical Demands Classes are offered in a mix of morning, early and late afternoon, and evening hours. Tenure Status Temporary Position Type Adjunct Faculty Employment Status Part-Time Position Length 4M Credits Per Year 3-9 Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Resume Cover Letter Transcripts Optional Documents Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Erie, Pennsylvania Campus 109 University Square Erie, Pennsylvania 16541 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 Ruskin, Florida Campus 105 Commercial Center Dr. Ruskin, Florida 33573 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
