    "https://gannon.peopleadmin.com/postings/14577": {
      "title": "Adjunct Nursing Instructor-Villa Maria School of Nursing (Faculty)",
      "description": "Gannon University | Adjunct Nursing Instructor-Villa Maria School of Nursing (Faculty) Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Search Position Description Library Log In /Create Account Help Adjunct Nursing Instructor-Villa Maria School of Nursing (Faculty) Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Posting Summary Position Title Adjunct Nursing Instructor-Villa Maria School of Nursing (Faculty) Posting Number AP019 Division School of Health Professions Department Col.Health Professions & Sci. Location Erie, Pa Position Summary Gannon University’s Villa Maria School of Nursing located at the Erie, Pennsylvania campus seeks qualified adjunct faculty to support our undergraduate and graduate programs. Gannon seeks excellence through inclusiveness and invites members of underrepresented groups to apply. Gannon University is committed to excellence in student-centered learning with an emphasis on student-learning outcomes. Established as one of the first baccalaureate nursing programs in Pennsylvania, the Villa Maria School of Nursing houses a large undergraduate BSN program as well as three graduate programs, all of which have earned CCNE accreditation. All faculty must be able to support and promote the University’s inclusive Mission, its Catholic identity, and its liberal arts and professional education traditions. This position will remain posted for 12 months. Candidates that best fit an open adjunct position, when it comes available, will be contacted to determine if they are interested at that time. At the end of 12 months this position will be closed and a new position will be posted if needed. Required Qualifications Must be a registered nurse with a master’s degree in nursing, or currently enrolled in a master’s program with plans to complete in 5 years. Must possess or be eligible to obtain nursing licensure in Pennsylvania. Must be able to support and promote the University’s inclusive Mission, its Catholic identity, and its liberal arts and professional education traditions. Preferred Qualifications An earned doctorate in nursing or a closely related field; applicants who are enrolled or in process of enrolling to doctoral programs are also encouraged to apply. A doctorate degree is required for a tenure track faculty appointment. Recent clinical and teaching experience in a program of higher education. Physical Demands Must be able to meet the physical demands associated with a busy academic and clinical environment. Tenure Status Temporary Position Type Adjunct Faculty Employment Status Part-Time Position Length 12M Credits Per Year As Assigned Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Resume Cover Letter Optional Documents Transcripts Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Erie, Pennsylvania Campus 109 University Square Erie, Pennsylvania 16541 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 Ruskin, Florida Campus 105 Commercial Center Dr. Ruskin, Florida 33573 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
